{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Contact and hands-on planning tools for aromatherapy sessions, blends, and memberships.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg:#f7efe6; /* warm cream */
      --muted:#6b5a4a; /* brown */
      --accent:#ad8a64; /* terracotta */
      --accent-2:#7a9a6d; /* sage */
      --card:#fff7ef;
      --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
      --radius:12px;
      --mono:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, 'Roboto Mono', monospace;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial;color:var(--muted);background:var(--bg);-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
    body{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center}
    .page{max-width:1100px;width:92%;padding:48px 0}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;margin-bottom:28px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin:0 10px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{text-decoration:underline}
    main{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px}
    .panel{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:22px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(102,85,70,0.06)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:22px}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px;color:#5a483b}
    .meta{font-size:13px;color:#7b695b}

    /* Session Planner */
    .planner .row{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:#58473b}
    input[type=text],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(110,90,75,0.12);background:transparent}
    textarea{min-height:90px}
    .controls{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
    button{background:var(--accent);color:white;border:0;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
    button.secondary{background:transparent;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid rgba(173,138,100,0.12)}
    .output{white-space:pre-wrap;background:var(--glass);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,85,0.06);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px;color:#4e3f34}

    /* Blend Builder */
    .blend .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}
    .blend .card{padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:white;border:1px solid rgba(120,100,85,0.04)}
    .chip{display:inline-block;background:#fff3ea;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:999px;font-size:13px;color:var(--accent-2);margin-right:6px}

    /* FAQ */
    details{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.9),transparent);padding:12px;border-radius:8px;margin-bottom:8px}
    summary{font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}

    footer{margin-top:28px;text-align:center;color:#6d5a4a;font-size:13px}

    /* pattern background band */
    .band{margin:20px 0 30px;padding:20px;border-radius:14px;background-image:url('assets/img/pattern.svg');background-color:rgba(250,244,238,0.8);background-blend-mode:overlay}

    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .brand .word{display:none}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden>AR</div>
        <div>
          <div class="word" style="font-weight:800;color:var(--muted)">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div class="meta">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="index.html">Home Base</a>
        <a href="services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html">Custom Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html">Apothecary</a>
        <a href="pricing.html">Memberships</a>
        <a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
        <a href="book.html">Schedule</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="panel">
          <h1>Plan a session, build a blend</h1>
          <p class="lead">Use the Session Planner to shape a personalized aromatherapy plan you can copy or send. Create a simple blend card and a safe dilution guide with the Blend Builder. All tools are local—no data leaves your browser.</p>

          <div class="band">
            <strong>Need help now?</strong>
            <div style="margin-top:8px" class="meta">Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}" style="color:var(--accent)">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
          </div>

          <div class="planner panel" style="margin-bottom:18px">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Session Planner</h2>
            <p class="meta">A short profile creates a plain-text plan you can copy. This is guidance, not medical advice. Language is intentionally conservative: aromatherapy may support well-being.</p>
            <div class="row">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="goal">Primary intention</label>
                <select id="goal">
                  <option value="calm">Calm or unwind</option>
                  <option value="focus">Support focus</option>
                  <option value="sleep">Evening ease</option>
                  <option value="mood">Uplift mood</option>
                  <option value="custom">Custom note</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="width:140px">
                <label for="length">Session length</label>
                <select id="length">
                  <option>10 minutes</option>
                  <option selected>20 minutes</option>
                  <option>30 minutes</option>
                  <option>60 minutes</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="frequency">Suggested cadence</label>
                <select id="frequency">
                  <option>Daily</option>
                  <option selected>2–3x per week</option>
                  <option>Weekly</option>
                  <option>On-demand</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="width:140px">
                <label for="environment">Setting</label>
                <select id="environment">
                  <option>Home</option>
                  <option>Workspace</option>
                  <option>Sleep space</option>
                  <option>Small group</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:12px">
              <label for="notes">Notes (allergies, preferences, contraindications)</label>
              <textarea id="notes" placeholder="e.g., avoid citrus on skin; pregnant; cat in household"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div class="controls">
              <button id="buildPlan">Create plan</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="clearPlan">Reset</button>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:12px">
              <label>Plan summary</label>
              <div id="planOutput" class="output" aria-live="polite">— Your plan will appear here —</div>
            </div>
            <div style="margin-top:10px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
              <button id="copyPlan">Copy plan</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="blend panel">
            <h2 style="margin-top:0">Blend Builder</h2>
            <p class="meta">Pick a desired vibe to get a suggested blend (non-medical), plus a conservative dilution guide. All oils listed are common examples; adjust for preferences and safety.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="vibe">Vibe</label>
                <select id="vibe">
                  <option value="calm">Calm & grounding</option>
                  <option value="focus">Clarity & focus</option>
                  <option value="sleep">Evening ease</option>
                  <option value="uplift">Uplift & brighten</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="width:140px">
                <label for="intensity">Intensity</label>
                <select id="intensity">
                  <option value="low">Low</option>
                  <option value="medium" selected>Medium</option>
                  <option value="high">High</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;margin-bottom:12px">
              <div style="flex:1">
                <label for="carrier">Carrier & final volume</label>
                <select id="carrier">
                  <option value="10">Fractionated coconut — 10 ml</option>
                  <option value="30">Sweet almond — 30 ml</option>
                  <option value="15">Jojoba — 15 ml</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div style="width:120px">
                <label for="dropsPerMl">Drops per ml</label>
                <input id="dropsPerMl" type="text" value="20" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
              <button id="makeBlend">Make blend</button>
              <button class="secondary" id="clearBlend">Clear</button>
            </div>
            <div class="grid">
              <div>
                <label>Blend card</label>
                <div id="blendCard" class="card output">— Create a blend to see the card —</div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label>Dilution guide</label>
                <div id="dilution" class="card output">— Dilution info will appear here —</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:10px">
              <button id="copyBlend">Copy blend text</button>
            </div>
          </div>

        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="panel" style="position:sticky;top:28px">
          <h3 style="margin-top:0">Quick contact</h3>
          <p class="meta">Prefer a live conversation? Use the details below or leave a short message.</p>
          <div style="margin:12px 0">
            <div class="chip">Phone</div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
            <div class="chip">Email</div>
            <div style="margin-bottom:8px"><a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
            <div class="chip">Location</div>
            <div class="meta">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          </div>

          <h4 style="margin-bottom:8px">FAQ highlights</h4>
          <details>
            <summary>Is aromatherapy safe?</summary>
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">Aromatherapy may support comfort and focus for some people. It is not a substitute for medical care. Follow dilution guidance, perform a patch test, and stop use if irritation occurs.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What about pregnancy & medications?</summary>
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">Pregnancy, breastfeeding, and some medications may require extra caution. Consult a qualified health provider before using essential oils in these circumstances.</div>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Pet safety</summary>
            <div class="meta" style="margin-top:6px">Some essential oils can be toxic to pets, especially cats and small mammals. Avoid close contact, keep oils out of reach, and consult a veterinarian for guidance.</div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div style="height:18px"></div>
        <div class="panel">
          <h4 style="margin-top:0">Memberships</h4>
          <p class="meta">A gentle way to stay consistent: recurring check-ins and curated blends. Learn more on the Memberships page.</p>
          <div style="margin-top:12px;display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:flex-end">
            <a href="pricing.html"><button>See plans</button></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a> — <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a></div>
      <div style="margin-top:8px;color:#8b7a6a">Small print: Content here is for educational purposes. Not a substitute for professional diagnosis or treatment.</div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // Utilities
    function safeText(el){return (el.value||el.options?.[el.selectedIndex]?.value||'').trim()}

    // Session Planner
    const buildBtn = document.getElementById('buildPlan');
    const clearPlan = document.getElementById('clearPlan');
    const planOutput = document.getElementById('planOutput');
    const copyPlan = document.getElementById('copyPlan');

    function generatePlanText(){
      const goal = safeText(document.getElementById('goal'));
      const length = safeText(document.getElementById('length'));
      const freq = safeText(document.getElementById('frequency'));
      const env = safeText(document.getElementById('environment'));
      const notes = safeText(document.getElementById('notes'));

      const date = new Date();
      const header = `Aromatherapy session plan — ${date.toLocaleDateString()}`;
      const lines = [];
      lines.push(header);
      lines.push('Intention: ' + (goal === 'custom' ? 'Custom note' : goal));
      lines.push('Length: ' + length);
      lines.push('Cadence: ' + freq);
      lines.push('Environment: ' + env);
      if(notes) lines.push('Notes: ' + notes);
      lines.push('\nSuggested approach:');
      lines.push('- Begin with 2–3 minutes quiet settling.');
      lines.push('- Use a single diffuser cycle or 2–5 drops on a tissue for short sessions.');
      lines.push('- If applying topically, use carrier oil and follow dilution guidance.');
      lines.push('\nSafety reminders: patch test prior to topical use; consult a provider for pregnancy or complex medical issues; keep oils away from pets.');
      lines.push('\nMembership / next step: See Memberships for repeating support or schedule an intake to personalise further.');
      return lines.join('\n');
    }

    buildBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      planOutput.textContent = generatePlanText();
    });
    clearPlan.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.getElementById('notes').value = '';
      document.getElementById('goal').selectedIndex = 0;
      document.getElementById('length').selectedIndex = 1;
      document.getElementById('frequency').selectedIndex = 1;
      document.getElementById('environment').selectedIndex = 0;
      planOutput.textContent = '— Your plan will appear here —';
    });
    copyPlan.addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      try{
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(planOutput.textContent);
        copyPlan.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(()=>copyPlan.textContent='Copy plan',1200);
      }catch(e){alert('Copy failed — please select and copy manually.')}
    });

    // Blend Builder
    const vibes = {
      calm: ['Lavender','Frankincense','Chamomile'],
      focus: ['Rosemary','Bergamot','Lemon'],
      sleep: ['Lavender','Cedarwood','Marjoram'],
      uplift: ['Grapefruit','Sweet Orange','Bergamot']
    };

    const intensityMap = {low:0.5, medium:1, high:2}; // relative modifier, used to weight drop counts

    function createBlend(){
      const vibe = safeText(document.getElementById('vibe'));
      const intensity = safeText(document.getElementById('intensity'));
      const carrierMl = Number(safeText(document.getElementById('carrier')))||10;
      const dropsPerMl = Number(document.getElementById('dropsPerMl').value) || 20;

      // typical safe dilution targets (percent) — conservative guidance
      // adult general: 1% (everyday), 2% (short-term/acute), children/older adults 0.25-0.5%
      const basePercent = intensity === 'high' ? 2 : intensity === 'medium' ? 1 : 0.5;

      // Convert percent to total drops: percent of final volume (ml) * dropsPerMl
      const totalDrops = Math.round((basePercent/100) * carrierMl * dropsPerMl);
      const oils = vibes[vibe] || ['Lavender','Sweet Orange'];

      // Distribute drops among chosen oils: 50/30/20 for first/second/third; adjust if totalDrops small
      const weights = [0.5,0.3,0.2];
      let dropCounts = oils.map((o,i)=>Math.max(1,Math.round(totalDrops * weights[i])));
      // Ensure sum matches totalDrops
      let sum = dropCounts.reduce((a,b)=>a+b,0);
      if(sum !== totalDrops){
        // adjust first oil to match
        dropCounts[0] += (totalDrops - sum);
      }

      // Build text
      const cardLines = [];
      cardLines.push(`Blend: ${vibe[0].toUpperCase()+vibe.slice(1)} — ${carrierMl} ml`);
      cardLines.push('Oils:');
      oils.forEach((oil,i)=>cardLines.push(`- ${oil}: ${dropCounts[i]} drops`));
      cardLines.push('\nDilution guidance (conservative):');
      cardLines.push(`- Target dilution: ${basePercent}% of final volume`);
      cardLines.push(`- Approx drops total: ${totalDrops} drops (using ${dropsPerMl} drops/ml)`);
      cardLines.push('\nNotes:');
      cardLines.push('- This is non-medical guidance. Perform a patch test before topical use.');
      cardLines.push('- Avoid use near pets without veterinary advice; some oils are not safe for cats.');
      cardLines.push('- For pregnancy, breastfeeding, or complex health matters, consult a qualified provider.');

      const cardText = cardLines.join('\n');

      // Also show a friendly visual card
      const visual = [];
      visual.push(`<strong>${vibe[0].toUpperCase()+vibe.slice(1)} — ${carrierMl} ml</strong>`);
      visual.push('<div style="margin-top:6px">');
      oils.forEach((oil,i)=>visual.push(`<div style=\"margin-bottom:6px\">• <em>${oil}</em> — ${dropCounts[i]} drops</div>`));
      visual.push('</div>');
      visual.push('<div style="margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#6a584c">Dilution: '+basePercent+'% — approx '+totalDrops+' drops total</div>');

      return {cardText, visualHtml: visual.join('')};
    }

    const makeBlendBtn = document.getElementById('makeBlend');
    const clearBlendBtn = document.getElementById('clearBlend');
    const blendCard = document.getElementById('blendCard');
    const dilution = document.getElementById('dilution');
    const copyBlendBtn = document.getElementById('copyBlend');

    let lastBlendText = '';

    makeBlendBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      const out = createBlend();
      blendCard.innerHTML = out.visualHtml;
      dilution.textContent = out.cardText.split('\n').slice(-7).join('\n');
      lastBlendText = out.cardText;
    });

    clearBlendBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
      document.getElementById('vibe').selectedIndex = 0;
      document.getElementById('intensity').selectedIndex = 1;
      document.getElementById('carrier').selectedIndex = 0;
      document.getElementById('dropsPerMl').value = '20';
      blendCard.textContent = '— Create a blend to see the card —';
      dilution.textContent = '— Dilution info will appear here —';
      lastBlendText = '';
    });

    copyBlendBtn.addEventListener('click', async ()=>{
      try{
        if(!lastBlendText) throw new Error('No blend');
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(lastBlendText);
        copyBlendBtn.textContent = 'Copied';
        setTimeout(()=>copyBlendBtn.textContent='Copy blend text',1200);
      }catch(e){alert('No blend to copy. Create one first.')}
    });

    // Make sure outputs are seeded with friendly reminders
    planOutput.textContent = '— Your plan will appear here —';
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and utilities for the aromatherapy membership site.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html : The contact page with two interactive tools — Session Planner and Blend Builder — plus quick contact info and FAQ highlights.

How to use locally:
1. Place contact.html in your site root alongside the other pages (index.html, services.html, blends.html, shop.html, pricing.html, about.html, book.html).
2. Ensure assets/img/pattern.svg exists for the background band. The CSS references that path.
3. Open contact.html in a browser. The page runs entirely client-side — no server required.

Interactive features summary:
- Session Planner: choose intention, length, cadence, environment, and add notes. Click "Create plan" to generate a plaintext plan summary. Use "Copy plan" to copy it to the clipboard. Reset clears inputs.
- Blend Builder: pick a vibe, intensity, carrier volume and approximate drops-per-ml value. Click "Make blend" to get a suggested blend card and conservative dilution guidance. "Copy blend text" copies the non-medical plain-text card. Reset clears the form.

Placeholders to replace in the HTML:
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}} (not used directly on this page but present in the site template)
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}

Safety notes included in the page copy and the widget outputs:
- Language avoids medical claims and uses "may support" phrasing.
- Dilution guidance is conservative and presented as general education, not medical direction.
- FAQ contains patch test, pregnancy, medication, and pet safety reminders.

Accessibility & privacy:
- Widgets use clear labels and live regions where appropriate.
- All functionality is local; no external network requests are made by the page's scripts.

If you need a matching SVG pattern (assets/img/pattern.svg) or further changes to the UI tone or palette, request the asset and I will provide it in the next chunk."}
BUNDLE_END
